      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.02,
      "end_seconds": 66.03,
      "duration_seconds": 17.01,
      "text": "It usually comes with slurred speech. The slurred speech? That's been since yesterday. So, um, as for slurred speech, I'd say mild. There was a sudden headache, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
