      "start_seconds": 238.9,
      "end_seconds": 251.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.01,
      "text": "okay: BMI works out to 31.5, pulse 90, temp 36.5 degrees and and BP is 144 over 96, weight 89 kilos, height 168 centimetres"
