      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.55,
      "end_seconds": 296.21,
      "duration_seconds": 12.66,
      "text": "all finished, thank you. From what you've told me and what I found, the most likely explanation is a possible stroke, within the treatment window"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.92,
      "end_seconds": 300.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Right, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
